{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >18 Original Tracks for a Vertical Bullet-Hell Shmup</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ad SHOOt, a vertical-scrolling bullet-hell shmup, each of the 7 stages and 7 bosses has its own unique theme. This original soundtrack includes those 14 tracks, plus music for the title screen, ending, and more, for a total of 18 tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Variety of Electronic Tracks with Genre Blends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are electronic compositions produced using a DAW, featuring a wide range of musical styles including jazz, country, and rock. Boss battle themes are especially fast-paced, around BPM 140\u2013160.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes Irregular Time Signatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several tracks use 5/4 or 7/4 time signatures to match the stage numbers and design, adding a unique rhythmical twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instrumental Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no vocal tracks or lyrics in this soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840560?t=1752683396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840560?t=1752683396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840560/cc72f150e6e45e3722666edc456399b51a079159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752683396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840560/cc72f150e6e45e3722666edc456399b51a079159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752683396","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >18 Original Tracks for a Vertical Bullet-Hell Shmup</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ad SHOOt, a vertical-scrolling bullet-hell shmup, each of the 7 stages and 7 bosses has its own unique theme. This original soundtrack includes those 14 tracks, plus music for the title screen, ending, and more, for a total of 18 tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Variety of Electronic Tracks with Genre Blends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are electronic compositions produced using a DAW, featuring a wide range of musical styles including jazz, country, and rock. Boss battle themes are especially fast-paced, around BPM 140\u2013160.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes Irregular Time Signatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several tracks use 5/4 or 7/4 time signatures to match the stage numbers and design, adding a unique rhythmical twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instrumental Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no vocal tracks or lyrics in this soundtrack.</p>","developers":["BOCSTE, Ltd."],"fullgame":{"appid":"2954360","name":"Ad SHOOt\uff08\u30a2\u30c9\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\uff09"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840560/66804809eb845e2686ff2acfced3c9c9e6cf5fbc/header.jpg?t=1752683396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Ad SHOOt\uff08\u30a2\u30c9\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\uff09 Soundtrack","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Ad SHOOt\uff08\u30a2\u30c9\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\uff09 Soundtrack - $6.99 USD","packageid":1350514,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":699}],"title":"Buy Ad SHOOt\uff08\u30a2\u30c9\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\uff09 Soundtrack"}],"packages":[1350514],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 202.8 MB available space<br></li><li><